    <string name="background_intro">For every reminder to reach you on time, Remember Me needs a few permissions. Red items are essential; the rest make it more reliable.</string>
    <string name="background_footer">Some phones stop background apps to save battery. If a reminder is ever late, come back to this page.</string>
