    <string name="steps_xiaomi">Settings → Apps → Manage apps → Remember Me: turn on Autostart, then Battery saver → No restrictions. In recent apps, long-press Remember Me and tap the lock.</string>
    <string name="steps_samsung">Settings → Battery → Background usage limits: add Remember Me to Never sleeping apps and make sure it is not in Sleeping apps. Then Settings → Apps → Remember Me → Battery → Unrestricted.</string>
    <string name="steps_huawei">Settings → Battery → App launch → Remember Me: turn off Manage automatically and turn on Auto-launch, Secondary launch and Run in background.</string>
    <string name="steps_oppo">Settings → Battery → Remember Me: Allow background activity. Then turn on Auto launch in app management, and lock Remember Me in recent apps.</string>
    <string name="steps_vivo">Settings → Battery → High background power consumption: allow Remember Me. Then i Manager → App manager → Autostart: turn it on.</string>
